      <sparkle:version>4</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/devinscottfountain/squish/releases/tag/v0.2.2</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
      <description><![CDATA[
<ul><li><b>Updates from inside Squish.</b> From now on Squish checks for new versions about once a day and installs them in one click, with no approval step. You can also use <b>Squish › Check for Updates…</b>, or turn checking off in <b>Settings › General › Updates</b>.</li><li><b>Vertical video previews.</b> The small before/after preview now shows the whole frame for vertical and square video, instead of cropping it to widescreen.</li></ul>
      ]]></description>
